              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Mutakozesanga liina lyange nze Musengwa Katonda mu bya matamatama, kuba nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe tija kuloba kubonereza oyo yeenayeena akozesa eriina lyange obubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.11",
