          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye olunaku olwomusanvu, lwa Sabbato yange nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe. Olwo mutalukolerangaku mulimo gwonagwona waire imwe beene, waire batabane baimwe, waire baghala baimwe, waire abairu baimwe abasaadha oba abakazi, waire ensolo dhaimwe, waire abasenze be musuza. Olwo abairu baimwe abasaadha n'abakazi, boona baghange okuwuumulanga ng'oti niimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhukirenga nga mwali bairu mu Misiri, nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe naabatoolayo, nga nkozesa amaani n'obuyinza bwange. Kyenva ni, mbalagira okukuumanga olunaku lwa Sabbato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
