          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Muteegwanizanga baka beene. Muteegwanizanga ndhu dha bantu bandi, waire enimiro dhaibwe, waire abairu baibwe abasaadha oba abakazi, waire ente dhaibwe, oba endogoyi, oba ekintu ekindi kyonakyona eky'omuntu owundi.” ",
